120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 87 0 R
/E (Pindex is a shared data layer for Portaldot V3. It reads the runtime metadata, builds a typed table for every event, and follows finalized blocks with a restart-safe cursor. Builders search any native or EVM address, see token holders and NFT owners, and query everything over an open API. A team that deploys a contract pastes its address and ABI and gets a working endpoint for its decoded events, with nothing new to host. Anything the indexer could not read is listed publicly, retried, and marked filled, so builders know exactly what they can trust.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
